# Lure's requirement (CR 509.1c) counted through a band (CR 702.22h): Bot1 attacks with Benalish Hero and Guerrilla Gorilla
# banded, each wearing a Lure, and Llanowar Elves alone, also Lured. Bot2's one creature, Ornithopter, can obey two
# requirements by blocking either member of the band - it blocks both - or one by blocking the Elves, so the declaration must
# be a block of the band: blocking the Elves is refused, blocking the Hero is taken, and only the Elves' 1 damage gets through.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Benalish Hero
Guerrilla Gorilla
Llanowar Elves
Lure
Lure
Lure
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Benalish Hero.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Guerrilla Gorilla.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lure.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Benalish Hero)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lure.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Guerrilla Gorilla)
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lure.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
[T7 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Benalish Hero > Bot2; Guerrilla Gorilla > Bot2; Llanowar Elves > Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Guerrilla Gorilla)
! Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Benalish Hero)
[T7 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 19
